    <item>
      <title>Squeak 2.23.4</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:51:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>22304</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.23.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>html{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#18181b;background:transparent;margin:0;padding:4px 2px}ul{margin:0 0 10px;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 10px}h4{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#52525b;margin:16px 0 6px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08)}code{font:12px ui-monospace,'SF Mono',monospace;background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:6px}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#f4f4f5}h4{color:#a1a1aa;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}code{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}}</style></head><body><ul><li>A long chat no longer opens to a blank transcript: it keeps scrolling to the newest message until it is on screen.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.23.3</h4><ul><li>Fixes the background service never starting on a new Mac. It now starts in under a second instead of quietly exiting.</li><li>Setup shows each stage of the first start and waits patiently on Macs with security software, instead of giving up and undoing the install.</li><li>Fixes a crash on Macs that don't have Conductor installed.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.23.2</h4><ul><li>If setup can't start the background service, Squeak says why and offers Send report with the details attached (secrets removed).</li><li>Reporting a problem is easier everywhere: a Report button beside every Try again, a gentle offer when something fails, and reports know your Squeak account so the team can reply.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
